OL,3,GNEWSAWoman says plan for new houses
OL,4,Apreventing home sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 86-year-old woman says she cannot
OL,7,Fsell her house because it is too close
OL,8,Fto the access of 160 planned new homes.
OL,10,FJD Clark wants to build the new estate
OL,11,Fin Brooks Road in Street, Somerset, as
OL,12,Fpart of wider plans to deliver 400 new
OL,13,Fhomes and new access roads.
OL,15,FBut local resident Rosalie Howard, who
OL,16,Fwants to sell her house and move closer
OL,17,Fto her family, said her estate agent
OL,18,Ftold her viewings are "completely and
OL,19,Fnegatively impacted" by the exit of the
OL,20,Fproposed development as it is opposite
OL,21,Fher home.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
