OL,3,GNEWSAWoman says plan for new houses
OL,4,Apreventing home sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FHoward, who was among a number of
OL,7,Fresidents who voiced their opposition
OL,8,Fat a Somerset Council meeting earlier
OL,9,Fthis month, said she was "devastated".
